{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-01_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-01","title":"眼前的傷","storyCode":"13-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"45872f2b873712d3a961eea624cf3155e8bc471ee4781c2719a6e3f61c2754a7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，你每次都能在換崗前這麼剛巧地醒過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你以前刻苦訓練的成果嗎，Guard？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……珀茜瓦爾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是太熱了，到了晚上還是這麼悶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有多久時間才換崗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五分鐘吧，你可以再坐一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去洗把臉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腿怎麼了，怎麼一瘸一拐的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……結晶蔓延過去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不是今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我遞下毛巾，珀茜瓦爾，在你左手邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粉色碎花的這條？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃，對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶回來的人比我們一開始預計的多，看來就算沒直接成為戰場，周邊那些小城鎮的狀況也在惡化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"影響的範圍比想像中大太多了。那些領地上的貴族……呵。他們當然視而不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些鎮子原本就是靠著和商隊做生意生存，現在打仗了，沒有運輸隊去倫蒂尼姆，他們還能有什麼好日子過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日子壞起來，感染者最先倒霉。以前他們還能在鎮子的最邊緣偷偷種點糧食。村裡人也會和他們做點小買賣，畢竟，賺誰的錢都是賺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，以前生活還算輕鬆愉快，大家還在乎體面，現在呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了算帳的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀茜瓦爾，眼下快到豆子成熟的季節了，田裡那些他們忙了一季的苗已經開始結豆莢了……他們卻選擇現在加入我們，逃離……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些感染者扔下了已經澆灌了那麼久的土地，放棄了幾個月後，乃至未來永遠的收成，也要離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……一定是真的沒有一點辦法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，感染者們，也許早就對這種“剝奪”習以為常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不能是每次的結論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您還在休息嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我聽到說話聲，您果然醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你，我都說了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這是要去值夜班嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要來點宵夜嗎？我這裡有罐頭，維多利亞產的。口味不算好，但很方便！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"香菸？酒？說不定能幫您在夜裡提提神，都很乾淨！還有磨刀石，施術單元，什麼都有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀茜瓦爾小姐，要不要點毛髮護理膏？現在這東西可不好找，畢竟會隨身帶這種東西的都是軍官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而軍官比較難死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是，只是把他們從死人堆裡挖出來比較難，他們一般都壓在最下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你又想要換我們的藥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，我，我總感覺最近很不舒服，身上特別的疼，還有些幻覺……我很怕石頭在往我腦子裡長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你每天往那些飄滿了粉塵的彈坑裡鑽，礦石病不惡化才怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能搞出來的只是些最最基本的粗製藥，能多少抑制點病情的發展而已，別以為吃了那東西能保命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在倒賣我們的藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接來的這批感染者告訴我，他們從一個騎摩托的薩卡茲那裡買過些抗礦石病的藥，“效果不錯”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賺得不少吧？就按照你口袋裡硬幣的數量來決定你的懲罰如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，呃，讓合適的東西出現在需要的地方，畢竟……這裡在打仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不會警告你第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但至少你給他們了。我們確實沒有信使給所有人發藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證！今後不會了，這次我只要一點！幾片都行！我……我這幾天都在發燒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫他申請點藥吧，這次把他登記下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，謝謝你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別謝我們，去謝謝醫生們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在實驗室不小心得了礦石病，公司不願意再付保險錢。從一個前途無量的精英，變成一個該死的感染者，接受這種轉變並不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好他們聽說過整合運動，他們找上了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不應該也謝謝你的老東家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對他們不止有感謝。但他們也永遠不會原諒我……我自己選的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過羅德島的設備精度太高了，我們學不來。算了，我們畢竟不是真的在開發藥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊，我們吃藥不是為了治好自己，只是為了，暫時先活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打針和吃藥解決不了礦石病。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……“賣藥傭兵”？“騎摩托車的”？我還沒混到需要別人記住我的那個地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可算不上名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想，我得想個威風的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲流浪者","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，去後面避難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀茜瓦爾，安撫下那些剛加入我們的平民，他們暫時經不起驚嚇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬——嗬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_334","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定要我殺了你？你的隊伍看起來狀態並不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九，怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幫人從北邊摸進了林子，羅曼內奇中了一箭，醫生正在處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這二十一個人，還有三五個躺在擔架上，他們居然想襲擊我們的營地？瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！瞧瞧啊，在我們國家的腹地，偉大首都的周邊，我看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"一大群該死的整合運動感染者！殺了我！來，有本事殺了我！要不然就讓我殺了你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"陰謀家，煽動者，暴徒，殺人犯……毒瘤、毒瘤、毒瘤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得我們打得那麼艱難，光憑那些野蠻的魔族佬怎麼可能戰勝我們？真正的敵人來自我們身邊，來自我們背後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡有混亂，哪裡就有你們的影子，哪裡就有感染者的影子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你們剛從前線撤下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們士氣低落，編制不全，傷口包紮得很潦草……看裝備型號，你們不是職業軍人。徵召兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是法夫公爵第四步兵營……第幾連？所屬黑溪村小隊和東漢姆村小隊，你們這裡有醫生嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，士兵！舉好你的武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，上士，維克多他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我命令你，舉好武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼大吼大叫的，維多利亞人。後面的營地還有平民在休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們維多利亞的平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"平民？如果他們不加入你們，他們不選擇成為暴徒和幫兇，維多利亞自會給他們應有的生活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，為什麼那些齷齪的人通通都是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我的國家裡，貧民區的流氓，荒地上的劫匪，邪惡暴虐的魔族，還有你們，滿懷陰謀的整合運動，你們都是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我們可敬的法夫公爵沒有感染，為什麼偉大的弗雷德里克三世陛下沒有感染，為什麼正直與道德的人就不會被礦石病侵襲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"人們到底是因感染而卑劣……還是因為卑劣而感染？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是卑劣傳染了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你膽敢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在也都是……齷齪的人，卑劣的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……難道不是嗎，長官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"這不一樣，這是光榮的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手臂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得到，那些剛剛冒頭的結晶。你的病情發展得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在為我的國家拼殺！我在殺那些薩卡茲，只是不小心沾上了點砂石，也可能是魔族的血——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應徵入伍的時候學了什麼？沒有一點有關活性源石環境的警告嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教官告訴我們，學會扣扳機射弩箭就行了……我們就學了兩個星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必也沒有配發任何阻斷劑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……什麼阻斷劑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我估計他們所有人都感染了，九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼可能？我一週前才在連隊裡做的體檢，很健康！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一週……感染很迅速。又或者，他們只是為了讓你們繼續待在前線，說了謊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾個躺在擔架上的，已經昏迷多久了？他們很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急性發作導致的死亡和崩解，對你們，對我們，都很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一直抬著擔架趕路，讓昏迷的傷員仰面向上是個正確的選擇，這樣能防止他們在無意識的狀況下窒息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……你們檢查過他們的背後嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維克多！該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該拉他來前線的……他爸要是知道他感染了，會殺了他，再殺了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"那些薩卡茲，他們的巫術把我們變成了感染者！我早就聽說過，魔族的詛咒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"他們玷污了我們的土地，還要污染我們的道德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上嘴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲天生易感染，他們的軍隊裡幾乎都是感染者。你們殺死他們，或者得了病的你們被他們殺死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒人處理屍體，就會……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我感覺我在戰壕裡聽過……某些聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上士，您那時告訴我，那是炮聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是炮聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的敵人試圖用一切手段傷害我們和我們的國家，包括他們的死亡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族佬，流寇，塔拉人……在弗雷德里克三世陛下還在的時候，從來沒有這些破事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……我們必須將這些渣滓驅逐出維多利亞，我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤恨的士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能做什麼……？我們能救維克多的命嗎？我們……我們在光榮的維多利亞的庇護下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白痴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再說一遍，你是個感染者了，病入膏肓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以說得再明確一點，和我們一樣，和在這裡的所有人一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1065_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就快要死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
